  "worked_solution": "In the model, we have $\\frac{3}{7}$ on the left.\n\nSince we need to divide by $3$, we split the whole into $3$ equal parts horizontally. \n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14133144/assets/abce136f75c1e24417ee4f1cb538b9de40f28e171205efa4f7962c21b5f06f6d.png)\n\nFrom the picture on the right, we obtain that the shaded part represents $\\frac{3}{21}$ of the whole.\n\nTherefore, the missing picture is the following:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14133144/assets/7f2e2077d0694862555808fc28adf95d20888dcf0897555c564a0c2ce23bd40c.png)",
